ent-OxydSmesUnit = technomancer SMES unit
    .desc = A superconducting magnetic energy storage unit. Feeds the grid when charge allows.

ent-OxydBreakerBox = breaker box
    .desc = A wall-mounted circuit breaker for a power line. Open it to cut the load.

ent-OxydPulsarConsole = pulsar control console
    .desc = Controls the orbital pulsar satellite — steer it onto a beam and bridge power back to the ship.

ent-OxydPulsarPowerBridge = pulsar power bridge
    .desc = Pulls the pulsar beam's energy down into the power grid.

ent-OxydPulsarFuelTank = pulsar fuel tank
    .desc = Pressurized reaction-mass tank for the pulsar satellite.

ent-OxydShipShieldGenerator = ship shield generator
    .desc = Projects an energy shield around the hull. Draws upkeep power per mode.

ent-OxydShipShieldGeneratorHull = hull shield generator
    .desc = A field-hardened variant that projects shields along the hull lines.

